6.  Non-finite value (`inf`) - ignored
7.  Negative value (`tps=-5.0`) - ignored
8.  Zero (`tps=0`) - ignored
9.  Non-string item (`"not a string"`) - ignored
10. Valid record requiring rounding (`tps=1.1111`)

